# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. See docs/VERIFY-github.md for how to get this value.
#
# The OAuth app's client ID. Public by design — the GitHub Device Flow has no client
# secret, which is why DSAHub can authenticate with no backend (PRD §38). It is read
# from the environment rather than hardcoded so a fork ships its own app without
# editing source (PRD §37).
#
# The OAuth app must have "Enable Device Flow" ticked, or GitHub answers 404.
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
